 requirements.</span></div><div style=3D"margin-bottom:9pt;text-align:justi=
fy"><span style=3D"color:#000000;font-family:'NVIDIA Sans',sans-serif;font-=
size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">For example, the USG already imp=
osed license conditions that limit the ability of foreign firms to create a=
nd offer as a service large-scale GPU clusters, such as imposing license co=
