cts. Once inventory has been written-off or written-down, it creates a new =
cost basis for the inventory that is not subsequently written-up. We record=
 a liability for noncancelable purchase commitments with suppliers for quan=
tities in excess of our future demand forecasts consistent with our valuati=
on of obsolete or excess inventory.</span></div></ix:continuation></ix:nonn=
